To wildportrait a species (text) at an x (number) by a y (number):
  If the species is "Pikachu":
    pikachubody at the x by the y.
    pikachubodyface at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Metapod":
    metapodbody at the x by the y.
    metapodbodyface at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Nidoran F":
    nidoranbody at the x by the y.
    nidoranbodyface at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Nidoran M":
    nidoranbody at the x by the y.
    nidoranbodyface at the x by the y.
    Let the horn be a list of 36, 24, 40, 17, 40 and 26.
    Shade Screen at the x by the y with the horn as 3.
  If the species is "Nidorina":
    nidoranbody at the x by the y.
    nidoranbodyface at the x by the y.
    Let the spines be a list of 17, 18, 20, 14, 23, 18, 26, 14, 29 and 20.
    Shade Screen at the x by the y with the spines as 3.
  If the species is "Nidorino":
    nidoranbody at the x by the y.
    nidoranbodyface at the x by the y.
    Let the horn be a list of 36, 24, 40, 17, 40 and 26.
    Shade Screen at the x by the y with the horn as 3.
    Let the spines be a list of 17, 18, 20, 14, 23, 18, 26, 14, 29 and 20.
    Shade Screen at the x by the y with the spines as 3.
  If the species is "Spearow":
    spearowbody at the x by the y.
    spearowbodyface at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Fearow":
    spearowbody at the x by the y.
    spearowbodyface at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Pidgeotto":
    spearowbody at the x by the y.
    spearowbodyface at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Pidgeot":
    spearowbody at the x by the y.
    spearowbodyface at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Butterfree":
    butterfreebody at the x by the y.
    butterfreebodyface at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Beedrill":
    beedrillbody at the x by the y.
    beedrillbodyface at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Raticate":
    rodentbody at the x by the y.
    rodentbodyface at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Ivysaur":
    evolvedplant at the x by the y.
    evolvedplantface at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Charmeleon":
    evolvedfire at the x by the y.
    evolvedfireface at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Wartortle":
    evolvedturtle at the x by the y.
    evolvedturtleface at the x by the y.

To wildback a species (text) at an x (number) by a y (number):
  If the species is "Pikachu":
