    nidoranbodyback at the x by the y.
    Let the spines be a list of 17, 18, 20, 14, 23, 18, 26, 14, 29 and 20.
    Shade Screen at the x by the y with the spines as 3.
  If the species is "Nidorino":
    nidoranbody at the x by the y.
    nidoranbodyback at the x by the y.
    Let the horn be a list of 36, 24, 40, 17, 40 and 26.
    Shade Screen at the x by the y with the horn as 3.
    Let the spines be a list of 17, 18, 20, 14, 23, 18, 26, 14, 29 and 20.
    Shade Screen at the x by the y with the spines as 3.
  If the species is "Spearow":
    spearowbody at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Fearow":
    spearowbody at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Pidgeotto":
    spearowbody at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Pidgeot":
    spearowbody at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Butterfree":
    butterfreebody at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Beedrill":
    beedrillbody at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Raticate":
    rodentbody at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Geodude":
    georeverse at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Onix":
